  "owner": "ace",
  "summary": "Corporate campaigns for farmed animals in Latin America and Southeast Asia: cage-free egg commitments, pig welfare commitments in Brazil, and replacing meat in institutional meals. A re-implementation of Animal Charity Evaluators' cost-effectiveness sheet for its 2025 recommendation, covering three programs (about 84% of programme spending).",
  "source": {
    "publisher": "Animal Charity Evaluators",
    "title": "Sinergia Animal – 2025 Recommended Charity",
    "url": "https://animalcharityevaluators.org/charity-review/sinergia-animal/",
    "sheet": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1BcZB3WeYarZC67MgFUjGKLWdLw2WVVZO8LitYcQb3fU/edit",
    "published": "2025-03-01",
    "retrieved": "2026-10-26",
    "license": "Unclear: check ACE's terms before republishing"
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "cage_free",
      "title": "Cage-free campaigns",
      "explainer": "Commitments by 39 food companies to stop buying eggs from caged hens. Benefits last as long as commitments are honoured, discounted for other groups' share of the credit and for companies that renege."
    },
    {
      "id": "meat_reduction",
      "title": "Institutional meat reduction",
      "explainer": "Nourishing Tomorrow: schools and other institutions in Argentina, Colombia and Indonesia replacing some meat meals. ACE assumes each commitment lasts a single year, likely an underestimate."
    },
    {
      "id": "pig_welfare",
      "title": "Pig welfare campaigns",
      "explainer": "Commitments by 10 Brazilian pork producers to end gestation crates and some piglet mutilations."
    },
    {
      "id": "costs",
      "title": "Costs",
      "explainer": "Each program's annual spending, scaled up by ACE to Sinergia's newer total budget."
    },
    {
      "id": "bottom",
      "title": "Bottom line",
      "explainer": "Suffering averted per dollar across the three modelled programs. The remaining ~16% of programme spending (work with financial institutions) is unmodelled, not assumed to be zero or equal."
    },
    {
      "id": "donor",
      "title": "Your dollar's share",
      "explainer": "charityevals adjustments on top of ACE's model."
    }
  ],
