      "kind": "judgment",
      "explainer": "Campaigning is mostly people: researchers, campaigners and corporate negotiators. Advocacy nonprofits typically spend well over half their budget on staff. We haven't seen Sinergia's own breakdown, so this is a guess. Range is ours."
