        "best": 0.35,
        "high": 0.55
      },
      "kind": "judgment",
      "explainer": "Campaigners and negotiators with these skills could earn considerably more in corporate communications, sales or consulting. Animal advocacy salaries are low even by nonprofit standards. Range is ours."
